{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29094","headline":"酬郭少府先奉使巡涝见寄兼呈裴明府 · 许浑","name":"酬郭少府先奉使巡涝见寄兼呈裴明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"载书携榼别池龙，十幅轻帆处处通。\n谢朓宅荒山翠里，王敦城古月明中。\n江村夜涨浮天水，泽国秋生动地风。\n饱食鱠鱼榜归檝，待君琴酒醉陶公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}